OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and warm
OL,6,Fevening to come with some hazy
OL,7,Fsunshine. Low cloud likely to spread
OL,8,Fin from the coasts overnight, with the
OL,9,Fpotential for mist and fog. The odd
OL,10,Fshower should not be ruled out,
OL,11,Fparticularly further north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIsolated showery outbreaks
OL,14,Fwill spread southeastwards throughout
OL,15,FFriday but tending to weaken as it
OL,16,Fdoes so. Many areas becoming dry
OL,17,Fduring the afternoon with sunny spells
OL,18,Fbut feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
